# The games image (Dockerfile.games) needs the bot and coord folders, the Rust workspace manifests and the forceteki source; keep
# the rest out, and what a local checkout builds (forceteki's packages, build and card data, Rust targets, caches).
# BuildKit reads this file for Dockerfile.games; fly.games.toml names it as the ignore file for flyctl.
*
!package.json
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!bot
!coord
!forceteki
forceteki/.git
forceteki/node_modules
forceteki/build
forceteki/test/json
coord/_build
coord/deps
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
bot/c/swu-c
bot/c/*.o
